  m_text: "2. Analyze the Headline\n\nMisinformation often uses dramatic headlines
    designed to create fear, panic, or anger.\n\nWarning signs:\n\u201CSECRET LEAK
    EXPOSED\u201D\n\u201CTHEY ARE LYING TO YOU\u201D\n\u201CSHARE BEFORE THIS GETS
    DELETED\u201D\nExtreme emotional wording\n\nReliable headlines are usually neutral
    and factual"
